<translation id="5479292367402350143">Ukuze wenze iJatter ibe okuzenzakalelayo kwakho:
1. Vula Amasethingi
2. Thepha i-App Yebhrawuza Evuleka Ngokuzenzekela
3. Khetha iJatter</translation>
<translation id="5482686278086727777">Ukuze uthole Izikhumbuzi Zethebhu ezisuka kuJatter, vula izaziso kumasethingi akho e-iOS.</translation>
<translation id="5521125884468363740">Ukuze ubone amathebhu wakho noma kuphi lapho usebenzisa i-Jatter, ngena ngemvume bese uvula ukuvumelanisa</translation>
<translation id="5534584691915394889">Lokhu kuzosetshenziselwa ukusungula imicimbi ku-Apple Calendar yakho nge-Jatter naku-Google Lens.</translation>
