<translation id="5671188105328420281">Amathiphu e-Jatter</translation>
<translation id="5688047395118852662">Leli khadi likubonisa iziphakamiso zokuthi ungathola kanjani okuningi ku-Jatter.</translation>
<translation id="5700709190537129682">I-Jatter ayikwazi ukuhlola iphasiwedi yakho</translation>
<translation id="5731004036450828399">Ukuze ugcine okhiye bokudlula bakho bephephile, kuzodingeka usungule iphinikhodi yokuthola kuqala.

