<translation id="5889847953983052353">Uma ivuliwe:
<ph name="BEGIN_INDENT" />  • Siza wenze i-Jatter ibe ngcono wenzela abantu abayisebenzisa njengawe.<ph name="END_INDENT" />

Izinto okumelwe uzicabangele:
<ph name="BEGIN_INDENT" />  • Imininingwane ithunyelwa ku-Google mayelana nokusebenzisa kwakho i-Jatter, kodwa ayiboshelwanga kuwe.

  • Uma i-Jatter iyeka ukusebenza, imininingwane emayelana nokuyeka ukusebenza ingase ihlanganise ulwazi oluthile lomuntu siqu.

  • Uma uvumelanisa umlando wakho ne-Google Account yakho, i-metrics ingase ihlanganise imininingwane emayelana nama-URL owavakashelayo.<ph name="END_INDENT" /></translation>
<translation id="5932787118589620366">Sula idatha yokubhrawuza kuJatter.</translation>
