<translation id="6104024151682120539">Vula ku-Jatter</translation>
<translation id="61109258320235597">Ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha ye-Jatter ku-Google Account yakho, faka umushwana wakho wokungena.</translation>
<translation id="6132149203299792222">Ngena ngemvume nge-Google Account yakho ukuze uvumelanise amaphasiwedi wakho, amabhukhimakhi, nokuningi.</translation>
<translation id="6148377327556085395">Faka amabhukhimakhi kuJatter</translation>
<translation id="6154098560469640583">Sebenzisa i-Jatter noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, kumadokhumenti, nakwamanye ama-app.</translation>
<translation id="6157162508956739031">Ngena ngemvume ngokushesha kuma-app namasayithi ngokugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalela amaphasiwedi akho nokhiye bokudlula kusuka kuJatter</translation>
