<translation id="7018284295775193585">I-Jatter ayikwazi ukubuyekeza</translation>
<translation id="7055269218854630176">Inhlangano yakho, <ph name="DOMAIN" /> iphatha i-akhawunti ongena kuyo ngemvume kanye nendlela engasetshenziswa ngayo i-Jatter. Umlawuli wakho angasetha noma abeke umkhawulo ezakhini ezithile.</translation>
