<translation id="7175400662502680481">Iphasiwedi yakho idalulwe ekwephulweni kwesivumelwano sedatha. I-Password Manager incoma ukuba uyishintshe manje.</translation>
<translation id="7185731475720473450">Izindlela zokukhokha kanye namakheli ngeke kubethelwe. Umlando wokubhrawuza ovela ku-Jatter ngeke uvumelanise.

Ngumuntu onomushwana wakho wokungena kuphela ongafunda idatha yakho ebetheliwe. Umshwana wokungena awuthunyelwa noma ulondolozwe yi-Google. Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />sula idatha ye-Jatter e-akhawuntini yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
