<translation id="7753923083404296545">Kuvulwe kuJatter Incognito</translation>
<translation id="7762622637388462191">Khiya ithebhu ye-Incognito yakho uma ushiya iJatter noma ushintshela ku-app ehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="7763454117143368771">Sebenzisa i-Jatter njengesiphequluli sakho esiyinhloko ukuze uhlale uvikelekile kumasayithi ayingozi futhi ugcine amphasiwedi akho aphephile</translation>
<translation id="7784950022329154821">Khiya amathebhu we-Incognito lapho uvala iJatter</translation>
<translation id="78025249032851484">I-Jatter yakho isiphelelwe yisikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="7859018312476869945">Uma uthayipha ibha yekheli noma ibhokisi losesho, i-Jatter ithumela lokho okuthayiphayo kunjini yakho yosesho yokuzenzakalelayo ukuze uthole iziphakamiso ezingcono. Lokhu kuvaliwe ku-Incognito.</translation>
<translation id="7890287942691234100">Qala ukusebenzisa iskena se-Jatter</translation>
<translation id="7905064834449738336">Uma usebenzisa iphasiwedi, i-Jatter iyakuxwayisa uma ishicilelwe ku-inthanethi. Uma yenza lokhu, amaphasiwedi akho namagama abasebenzisi ayabethelwa, ukuze angakwazi ukufundwa yinoma ngubani, kubandakanya ne-Google.</translation>
