<translation id="9031260906956926157">Enye idatha yakho yeJatter ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account.
Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="9050790730841755540">Sebenzisa i-Jatter noma nini uma uthepha amalinki kwamanye ama-app.</translation>
<translation id="9059693977935746710">Ngeke kudingeke ukuthi ukhumbule le phasiwedi. Izolondolozwa Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi se-<ph name="EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="9089354809943900324">I-Jatter ayikho kudethi</translation>
<translation id="9105645282262300612">Ithiphu yeJatter: Sesha lokho okubonayo</translation>
<translation id="9152995302810511799">Ithiphu yeJatter: Thola ukuvikeleka okuqine kakhulu kweJatter</translation>
<translation id="9177628952266852500"><ph name="EMAIL" />. IJatter iphethwe.</translation>
<translation id="921174536258924340">I-Jatter ayikwazanga ukuhlola wonke amaphasiwedi. Zama futhi kusasa noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />hlola amaphasiwedi ku-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="924957577793602335">Yenza i-Jatter Ibe ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="981812233959540767">Dlala iGeyimu ye-Dino ye-Jatter</translation>
<translation id="985602178874221306">Ababhali be-Jatter</translation>
</translationbundle>